RustyCore Extractors
====================

Project coordination and original RustyCore Extractors work:
  alseif0x and contributors to rustycore-extractors

Planned compatibility source is derived from TrinityCoreLegacy/TrinityCore at
commit 92796557f9b0ba3d2d1c7c770f535153154cf83e. TrinityCore is itself a
derivation/rewrite with contributions from the WoW Daemon Team, MaNGOS,
TrinityCore and many individual contributors. Authorship remains with those
contributors and is recorded in the pinned repository's AUTHORS file and Git
history. No attribution in this file transfers ownership.

Third-party authors and copyright holders are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and licensing/inventory.json. Copied or derived source
files must retain their original per-file notices.
